WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:48.000
Morning triage: 47 unreads across four channels become one prioritized briefing.

00:48.000 --> 01:08.000
A jammed printer — the admin PIN is buried in a five-month-old #facilities post. Found.

01:08.000 --> 01:34.000
"What was decided about the Postgres 17 migration?" — answered from the #engineering thread.

01:34.000 --> 01:58.000
A tagged, threaded reply posted back to the incident — bump the pool to 250, tag Kai.

01:58.000 --> 02:30.000
Who is Alex Torres? A user lookup names the new backend engineer.

02:30.000 --> 02:54.000
Closing loops: a reaction on the resolution message, #incidents marked as read.

02:54.000 --> 03:24.000
Export the last 24 hours with threads for the post-mortem — ending the morning at 0 unreads.
